# Pairs with NoEarlyGraceRelease. A death releases the grace only after the
# grain has seen it for one lease plus the margin, which is long enough for every
# lease the previous activation granted to lapse; the mutant ages the sighting
# sooner, while a silo falsely declared dead still trusts its old lease.
MODULE: SightingAgesKeepsOldLeases
TARGET: NoEarlyGraceRelease
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a death sighting ages before the leases of the previous activation lapse
PERTURBS: SightingAges
BOUNDS: NumSilos = 1, MaxRestarts = 1, MaxFalseDeaths = 1

--- FIND
    /\ lease' = [u \in Silos |-> IF lease[u] = "old" THEN "none" ELSE lease[u]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the sighting ages inside one lease plus the margin.
    /\ lease' = lease
--- END
